OL,3,GNEWSARise in animal concerns this
OL,4,Asummer, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rescue charity has reported an
OL,7,Fincrease in reports of animal welfare
OL,8,Fconcerns due to hot weather.
OL,10,FGuernsey experienced mean temperatures
OL,11,Fabout 3C (5.4F) above the average
OL,12,Fbetween 1 June and 15 August, according
OL,13,Fto Jersey Met.
OL,15,FThe GSPCA said there had "rarely been a
OL,16,Fday" this summer without reports of
OL,17,Fdogs being exercised in high
OL,18,Ftemperatures, pets kept in poorly
OL,19,Fventilated areas and wildlife
OL,20,Fstruggling in dry conditions.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
