OL,3,GNEWSARise in animal concerns this
OL,4,Asummer, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FManager Steve Byrne said the charity
OL,7,Fdealt with "no serious cases" but it
OL,8,F"certainly had more concerns and
OL,9,Freports than in recent years".
